cending प्रधान and पुरुष (matter and spirit).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "an epithet of Śiva. -भाज्a.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "most distinguished.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "receiving the chief share.-मन्त्रिन् m. the prime-minister. -वादिन् m. one who asserts the Sāṅkhya doctrine (of प्रधान). -वासस् n. a principal garment; (du.) the two chief garments.-वृष्टिः f. a heavy shower of rain. -शिष्ट a. taught or prescribed as of primary importance. -सभिकः the chief of a gambling house.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["pradhaana", "pradhāna"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pradhaana", "pradhāna"]}], "praDanaka": [{"id": "praDAnaka", "headword": "प्रधानक", "headword_slp1": "praDAnaka", "fold": "praDanaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्रधानक [pradhānaka], a. Chief, principal. -कम् The original germ out of which the material universe is evolved.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["pradhaanaka", "pradhānaka"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pradhaanaka", "pradhānaka"]}], "praDanata": [{"id": "praDAnatA", "headword": "प्रधानता", "headword_slp1": "praDAnatA", "fold": "praDanata", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्रधानता [pradhānatā] त्वम् [tvam], त्वम् = प्राधान्य q. v.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["pradhaanataa", "pradhānatā"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pradhaanataa", "pradhānatā"]}], "praDanena": [{"id": "praDAnena", "headword": "प्रधानेन", "headword_slp1": "praDAnena", "fold": "praDanena", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्रधानेन [pradhānēna], = प्राधान्येन chiefly; न हि शक्यं प्रधानेन श्रेयः संख्यातुमात्मनः Mb.12.287.58.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["pradhaanena", "pradhānena"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pradhaanena", "pradhānena"]}], "praDaraRa": [{"id": "praDAraRa", "headword": "प्रधारण", "headword_slp1": "praDAraRa", "fold": "praDaraRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्रधारण [pra